# ----------------------------------------
# AGENT CONFIGURATION (The "Split" Strategy)
# ----------------------------------------

# 1. First, ignore EVERYTHING inside .claude to be safe
.claude/*

# 2. Now, "un-ignore" (whitelist) the specific logic you want to share
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/workflows/
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/docs/
!.claude/project_instructions.md

# 3. Explicitly double-check that sensitive files are ignored
# (Redundant safety net for files that often hold keys or chat history)
.claude/mcp-settings.json
.claude/history/
.claude/memories/
.claude/chats/

# ----------------------------------------
# Work in progress
temp/

# Project-specific documentation (for review only)
FOR_CHRIS.md

# OS files
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/

# Dependencies (if future npm usage)
node_modules/
package-lock.json

